        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/datasets/root_auxin_reflux_fountain/README.md#L1-L40> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
